    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the bravest, most fearless, and undeniably fluffiest warriors the world has ever seen: Combat Hamsters. Armed with an arsenal of powerful weapons, these feisty rodents await your command. Strategically maneuver them across procedurally generated, fully destructible terrain. Dodge deadly mines, trigger explosive barrels to outsmart your foes, and fight to be the last Coham standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skill based combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Up to 6 players at the same time, against each other or team up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physics based multiplayer with destructible terrain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Procedurally generated levels for unique gameplay every single time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple unique weapons to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single player mode against AI Bots</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/a6a223e476016906debf9624e07ea445.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/a6a223e476016906debf9624e07ea445.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/a6a223e476016906debf9624e07ea445.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical battles with easy-to-learn, hard-to-master shooting mechanics. Pick the perfect weapons, position your combat hamster wisely, and aim with precision to maximize the damage</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/f193f50e2ac5430663e6b5a82344aa6a.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/f193f50e2ac5430663e6b5a82344aa6a.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/f193f50e2ac5430663e6b5a82344aa6a.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique weapons, each with its own strategic advantage. Whether it\u2019s the Rocket Launcher, Cluster Grenade, Minigun, Air Strike, Jetpack, Haymaker... your tactics decide the outcome</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jetpack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/e440d4b93f531e8ed60545b5ce95b214.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/e440d4b93f531e8ed60545b5ce95b214.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/e440d4b93f531e8ed60545b5ce95b214.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jetpack is one of the trickiest tools to master, but in skilled hands, it\u2019s incredibly powerful. Soar your coham over the battlefield and drop a bomb right on target. Use your momentum wisely for a precise explosion \u2014 and be sure to land gently to keep your hamster safe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/ff28d14a62a7dbc0e8751eecf75db047.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/ff28d14a62a7dbc0e8751eecf75db047.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/ff28d14a62a7dbc0e8751eecf75db047.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 6 players, each controlling their own crab avatar. The real fun begins in multiplayer hamster battles \u2014 challenge your friends and see who\u2019s the last hamster standing! You can also team up with a friend and join forces to take on the chaos together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single-Player</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/47cc3ae6030f69dc9c900bfade540be0.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/47cc3ae6030f69dc9c900bfade540be0.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/47cc3ae6030f69dc9c900bfade540be0.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play solo against hamster bots across three difficulty levels\u2014these clever little rodents don\u2019t go down without a fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hazards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/adcfce63acf100125f2ae11ab467a832.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/adcfce63acf100125f2ae11ab467a832.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/adcfce63acf100125f2ae11ab467a832.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is littered with mines and explosive barrels. Avoid them at all costs \u2014 or use them to your advantage! Plan your coham\u2019s position carefully to stay safe or use them as deadly traps for your opponents! Speaking of deadly \u2014 multiple death animations await, each varying based on the weapon, biome, and the circumstances of defeat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Celebration Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/01067582ea4b81747a29662a46cf6431.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/01067582ea4b81747a29662a46cf6431.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/01067582ea4b81747a29662a46cf6431.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory never looked this adorable \u2014 now go celebrate like a true coham champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the bravest, most fearless, and undeniably fluffiest warriors the world has ever seen: Combat Hamsters. Armed with an arsenal of powerful weapons, these feisty rodents await your command. Strategically maneuver them across procedurally generated, fully destructible terrain. Dodge deadly mines, trigger explosive barrels to outsmart your foes, and fight to be the last Coham standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skill based combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Up to 6 players at the same time, against each other or team up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physics based multiplayer with destructible terrain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Procedurally generated levels for unique gameplay every single time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple unique weapons to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single player mode against AI Bots</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/a6a223e476016906debf9624e07ea445.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/a6a223e476016906debf9624e07ea445.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/a6a223e476016906debf9624e07ea445.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical battles with easy-to-learn, hard-to-master shooting mechanics. Pick the perfect weapons, position your combat hamster wisely, and aim with precision to maximize the damage</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/f193f50e2ac5430663e6b5a82344aa6a.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/f193f50e2ac5430663e6b5a82344aa6a.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/f193f50e2ac5430663e6b5a82344aa6a.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique weapons, each with its own strategic advantage. Whether it\u2019s the Rocket Launcher, Cluster Grenade, Minigun, Air Strike, Jetpack, Haymaker... your tactics decide the outcome</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jetpack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/e440d4b93f531e8ed60545b5ce95b214.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/e440d4b93f531e8ed60545b5ce95b214.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/e440d4b93f531e8ed60545b5ce95b214.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jetpack is one of the trickiest tools to master, but in skilled hands, it\u2019s incredibly powerful. Soar your coham over the battlefield and drop a bomb right on target. Use your momentum wisely for a precise explosion \u2014 and be sure to land gently to keep your hamster safe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/ff28d14a62a7dbc0e8751eecf75db047.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/ff28d14a62a7dbc0e8751eecf75db047.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/ff28d14a62a7dbc0e8751eecf75db047.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 6 players, each controlling their own crab avatar. The real fun begins in multiplayer hamster battles \u2014 challenge your friends and see who\u2019s the last hamster standing! You can also team up with a friend and join forces to take on the chaos together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single-Player</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/47cc3ae6030f69dc9c900bfade540be0.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/47cc3ae6030f69dc9c900bfade540be0.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/47cc3ae6030f69dc9c900bfade540be0.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play solo against hamster bots across three difficulty levels\u2014these clever little rodents don\u2019t go down without a fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hazards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/adcfce63acf100125f2ae11ab467a832.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/adcfce63acf100125f2ae11ab467a832.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/adcfce63acf100125f2ae11ab467a832.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is littered with mines and explosive barrels. Avoid them at all costs \u2014 or use them to your advantage! Plan your coham\u2019s position carefully to stay safe or use them as deadly traps for your opponents! Speaking of deadly \u2014 multiple death animations await, each varying based on the weapon, biome, and the circumstances of defeat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Celebration Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/01067582ea4b81747a29662a46cf6431.poster.avif?t=1748602317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/01067582ea4b81747a29662a46cf6431.webm?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621090/extras/01067582ea4b81747a29662a46cf6431.mp4?t=1748602317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory never looked this adorable \u2014 now go celebrate like a true coham champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
